<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-MARBELLA MEN'S TENNIS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MARBELLA MEN'S TENNIS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MARBELLA, Spain 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the Marbella men's tennis tournament on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Marc Goellner (Germany) beat 6-Francisco Clavet (Spain) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Fernando Vicente (Spain) beat 3-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) 6-7 (5-7) 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>Christian Ruud (Norway) beat 7-Javier Sanchez (Spain) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>2-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Jordi Burillo (Spain) 7-5 6-3.</p>
</text>
